<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Görsel Dönüştürücü</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .main-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .intro-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1a2a4b;
        }
        .intro-text {
            color: #6c757d;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .card-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #5d67e6;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .card-title-link {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1a2a4b;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .card-text {
            color: #6c757d;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container main-container text-center py-5">
    <h1 class="intro-title display-4 mb-3">Görsellerinizi Kolayca Yönetin</h1>

    <ul class="intro-text lead mb-5 text-start">
        <li> Hızlı ve güvenilir görsel sıkıştırma ve dönüştürme araçları hizmetinizde.</li>
        <li>Cihazınızdan en fazla 10 adet görsel seçebilirsiniz veya görselleri bırakma alanına sürükleyebilirsiniz.</li>
        <li>Seçili görsel en fazla 10 MB olmak zorundadır.</li>
    </ul>

</div>
<div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="row g-4 ">
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <a href="{{ path('app_image_compress') }}" class="text-decoration-none">
                <div class="card p-5 feature-card h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
                    <span class="card-icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-arrows-collapse" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h13a.5.5 1 0 0 1 0 1h-13A.5.5 0 0 1 1 8m13-3.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-13a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h13a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5m-13 7a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h13a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-13a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="card-title-link mt-3 text-center">Görsel Sıkıştırma</h2>
                    <p class="card-text text-center mt-2">Dosya boyutunu düşürerek hız kazanın. Kaliteyi korurken sıkıştırın.</p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <a href="{{ path('app_image_convert') }}" class="text-decoration-none">
                <div class="card p-5 feature-card h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
                    <span class="card-icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-files" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M13 10H3c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h10c.55 0 1 .45 1 1v6c0 .55-.45 1-1 1zM3 3v6h10V3H3zm12-2H4c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v1h11c.55 0 1 .45 1 1v11h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V2c0-.55-.45-1-1-1z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="card-title-link mt-3 text-center">Görsel Dönüştürme</h2>
                    <p class="card-text text-center mt-2">Farklı formatlara dönüştürün (JPG, PNG, WebP).</p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
                <a href="{{ path('app_image_crop') }}" class="text-decoration-none">
                    <div class="card p-5 feature-card h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
                    <span class="card-icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-arrow-repeat" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M11.534 7h3.932a.25.25 0 0 1 .192.41l-1.92 2.9A.25.25 0 0 1 13.52 10.5h-3.932a.25.25 0 0 1-.192-.41l1.92-2.9a.25.25 0 0 1 .192-.09m-7.068 0h3.932a.25.25 0 0 0 .192-.41L6.48 4.6A.25.25 0 0 0 6.48 4.6L4.56 1.7A.25.25 0 0 0 4.368 1.5h-3.932a.25.25 0 0 0-.192.41l1.92 2.9a.25.25 0 0 0-.192.41L1.76 10.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .192.41h3.932a.25.25 0 0 0 .192-.41l-1.92-2.9a.25.25 0 0 0-.192-.09m7.068 0h3.932a.25.25 0 0 0 .192-.41L13.52 4.6A.25.25 0 0 0 13.52 4.6L11.6 1.7A.25.25 0 0 0 11.408 1.5h-3.932a.25.25 0 0 0-.192.41l1.92 2.9a.25.25 0 0 0-.192.41L7.76 10.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .192.41h3.932a.25.25 0 0 0 .192-.41l-1.92-2.9a.25.25 0 0 0-.192-.09m-7.068 0h3.932a.25.25 0 0 0 .192-.41L6.48 4.6A.25.25 0 0 0 6.48 4.6L4.56 1.7A.25.25 0 0 0 4.368 1.5h-3.932a.25.25 0 0 0-.192.41l1.92 2.9a.25.25 0 0 0-.192.41L1.76 10.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .192.41h3.932a.25.25 0 0 0 .192-.41l-1.92-2.9a.25.25 0 0 0-.192-.09"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                        <h2 class="card-title-link mt-3 text-center">Görsel Kırpma</h2>
                        <p class="card-text text-center mt-2">İstediğiniz alanı öne çıkarın. Gereksiz detayları kırpın ve sadeleştirin.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-3 ">
            <a href="{{ path('seo_analyzer') }}" class="text-decoration-none">
                <div class="card p-5 feature-card h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
                    <span class="card-icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-search" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M11.742 10.344a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-1.397 1.398h-.001q.044.06.098.115l3.85 3.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.415-1.414l-3.85-3.85a1 1 0 0 0-.115-.1zM12 6.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="card-title-link mt-3 text-center">Seo Analyzer</h2>
                    <p class="card-text text-center mt-2">Web sitenizin SEO performansını anında analiz edin. Eksiklerinizi görün ve iyileştirme fırsatlarını keşfedin!</p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
